# 子狐 (Alice) は know-foxes trait を持ち、 妖狐 (Bob) を knownHamster として認識する。
# Day 1 で適当に村人を処刑し、 view 検証のみ行う。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=子狐
!Bob=妖狐
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Dave→Carol
Eve→Dave

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Dave 4 / Carol 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: werehamster_won
# survivors: Alice, Bob, Carol, Eve
# == end ==

# @expect-view actor:Alice field:knownHamster value:Bob
